# Business Structure & System Architecture Documentation

This document outlines the business domain model, folder structure, and software architecture of the **University Ceremony Attire Rental & Marketplace System**. It serves as the blueprint for development, mapping each code module to its respective business capabilities.

---

## 1. Architectural Design Goals

The system utilizes a decoupled client-server architecture:
- **Backend**: Built with Django and Django REST Framework (DRF), providing a secure, stateless REST API.
- **Frontend**: A React application built with Vite and styled with Tailwind CSS, offering a responsive, role-based user interface.
- **Data & Tasks**: PostgreSQL for relational storage, and Redis/Celery for background job processing (e.g., asynchronous notifications).

